WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.040
I need to head upstairs for the medication round,
so you'll be in charge of teatime.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.114
It's just you and two housemates at the table.

00:00:06.264 --> 00:00:10.824
Before you start, make sure to check the information
we have, like the mealtime plan, patient records,

00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:12.184
and reference tools.

00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:13.010
They're all on the right.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.240
There's nothing urgent for you, but it's important
to notice what matters today.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.160
Once you're ready, head over to the table.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:19.742
You've got this.